Track per-term provenance on Structure

Structure now carries a many-to-one map
`semantic_el: BTreeMap<TermId, ElId>`, mirroring eqlog.eql's
`semantic_el(TermNode, Structure) -> El`. algebraize records every
term occurrence it walks (including the explicit var in an IfAtom::Var
binding). canonicalise_refs rewrites its values to class roots, same
as var_els.

emit_type_conflict moved onto Structure as a method. On detecting a
type mismatch, it iterates semantic_el and emits one
CompileError::ConflictingTermType per term whose element is currently
in the conflicting class, using `ast.loc(term_id)` as the error
location. A fallback with Location(0, 0) is kept for classes with no
recorded term (e.g. ambient model elements).
